chapter AFP

session MFODL_Syntax = HOL +
  description
    "The parse trees of MonPoly's formula syntax (MFODL_Syntax) and their post-processing
     (MFODL_Post), and OCaml's escaping of strings in MonPoly's messages (String_Escape). The
     bottom of the logic layer: the formula parser produces these parse trees, and the front end
     (session MFODL_Frontend) converts them into the logic's formulas, so neither the logic nor
     the front end depends on a parser."
  theories
    MFODL_Syntax
    MFODL_Post
    String_Escape
